    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A weekend hunting trip turns into a fight for your soul.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Clint and his friend Eddie head out to a remote hunting cabin, they\u2019re expecting cold beer, quiet woods, and a clean kill. Instead, something else is waiting... something old, burned, and full of rage.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818040/extras/efe837e09ed0d7aeb41b84077bf3d0e7.poster.avif?t=1751589356\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818040/extras/efe837e09ed0d7aeb41b84077bf3d0e7.webm?t=1751589356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818040/extras/efe837e09ed0d7aeb41b84077bf3d0e7.mp4?t=1751589356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the cabin and its haunted woods, uncover a buried past, and survive as reality unravels around you.<br>What was once human now wears a bridal veil. And it knows your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person psychological horror rooted in <strong>folk tragedy and demonic possession</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric exploration with light combat -\u00a0<strong>use axe, flashlight, and firearms to survive</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth through <strong>environmental storytelling, found objects, and eerie dialogue</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short-form horror experience</strong></p></li></ul>",
